  Ported parts: the PRoot native-library pipeline (runtime_tools/, scripts/prepare_android_runtime_*),
  the verified runtime downloader, runtime archive extraction, environment activation with
  rollback, device storage binding, the process watchdog and the process launcher.

Software downloaded and executed at runtime (not bundled in this APK, licensed separately):

  - OpenChamber (@openchamber/web)   - the web server and UI the app displays
  - OpenCode (@opencode/cli)         - the agent runtime used by OpenChamber
  - Alpine Linux minirootfs 3.24.1   - the guest userland
  - Node.js, npm, git, ripgrep and other Alpine packages, each under its own license

Bundled native components (PRoot, libtalloc, libandroid-shmem) are built from the sources
pinned in runtime_tools/runtime_sources.lock.json and keep their own licenses. Source
locations and checksums are recorded in that file; build instructions and known validation
limits are documented in docs/fdroid-source-build.md. PRoot is a bundled user-space
chroot/bind-mount launcher, not a component downloaded by the app at runtime.

  - PRoot 5.1.107.97: GPL-2.0; https://github.com/termux/proot
  - talloc 2.5.0: LGPL-3.0-or-later; https://www.samba.org/ftp/talloc/
  - libandroid-shmem 0.7: BSD-3-Clause; https://github.com/termux/libandroid-shmem

Local compatibility patches and build adaptations are in runtime_tools/patches/ and
scripts/build_android_runtime_native.py. This experimental branch is not a release;
redistribution still requires the applicable license texts and corresponding-source obligations.

